// preprocessor-defined-operator.  Measured against the established compiler.
// THE NEIGHBOUR THIS SLICE ALSO FIXES: #ifdef read macros.find()
// alone, so `#ifdef __LINE__` was TRUE here and FALSE on the
// established compiler. The two spellings now share one predicate because the
// established compiler has them agree.
#ifdef __CGC__
#define V 1.0
#else
#define V 2.0
#endif
float4 main() : COLOR { return V; }
